  "problem": "A research example packet could remain valid after its source/schema generation diverged from an attached request or result. Executed steps could lack receipts. Documented but unexecuted steps could look completed. Restricted routes could be silently treated as executed. Expected output could freeze fragile numeric constants. A changed source schema could keep a stale example live. Live data could be fabricated for a demo.",
  "resulting_behavior": "Example packets live in packages/enrichment/example-packet.mjs with representative packets under evaluation/research-program/examples/. A packet is invalid if source/schema generation differs from an attached request or result. Every executed step has a receipt; documented but unexecuted steps are labeled; unavailable restricted steps stay unavailable. Expected output is a field/type shape, not a numeric constant. A changed source schema invalidates the example and preserves the previous dated version. No live data is fabricated. Last-good generation live-2026-09-03-85b50522b420 is unchanged. Sealed identity schema-catalog.mjs and example-runner.mjs are unchanged.",
